		}
		{
			id: "10F1FDE5B519272D"
			title: "Catch Three Named Fish and Hang Three Mounts on the Inn Wall"
			subtitle: "The Fishing Derby."
			icon: "aquaculture:oak_fish_mount"
			description: ["Nella: \"Bluegill and perch off the pier any time. Catfish is a night fish and he wants a worm on the hook.\"", "", "Catch one Bluegill, one Perch and one Catfish off the pier — bluegill and perch in daylight, catfish after dark on a worm, and the box in your bag holds thirty-two. Then hang three of your Oak Fish Mounts on the inn wall; Nella shipped two at the salting and two more at the ice.", "", "Pays 50 Valley Scrip toward the town's winter debt."]
			x: 4.0d
			y: -1.5d
