			icon: "quarryplus:flex_marker"
			description: ["Tobin: \"The site's surveyed, so the pad is mine to cut. The rig isn't mine to switch on until the town says so. Those are different problems.\"", "", "Level the 9x9 pad on the site the deep survey picked and run Energy Duct from the reactor grid out to it, then set the Flexible Marker on the corner stake and type the box — a side of 64 is well inside this pack's 256 cap.", "", "The pad, the marker and the power lane are the whole rig except the Deed. The Flexible Marker and the spare Markers are in this payout."]
			x: 10.0d
