			subtitle: "Six of eight neighbours' stories closed."
			icon: "minecraft:emerald"
			description: ["Oda: \"I don't keep a book of who likes you. I keep a book of who you've finished a thing for. Six is the number.\"", "", "Standing is simply how many of the eight named residents' stories your team has finished: Wisp, Marnie, Halden, Pip, Bram, Tobin, Nella, Oda. At six, the valley considers you one of its own and Oda will sell you the Works Deed.", "", "This card is never drawn in the book. A KubeJS listener ticks it the moment the sixth chain closes. Run /valley check standing to see the count."]
			x: 2.0d
