		{
			id: "2FE67859CD152D29"
			title: "Buy the Works Deed: 80 Valley Scrip and Standing: Trusted"
			subtitle: "Six of eight chains closed."
			icon: "valley:deed"
			description: ["Halden: \"Josie meant the Works to belong to whoever stayed. Nobody has argued about it in four years.\"", "", "Pay 80 Valley Scrip at Oda's counter. The second half is Standing: Trusted — six of the eight resident chains closed — and it locks itself open the moment the sixth one does.", "", "Wisp's people came in off the ice · Marnie sat down at her own table · Halden's rounds · Pip's satchel · Bram's cocoa · Tobin's signature on the readings · Nella's tomato · Oda's ledger. Run /valley check standing for the count.", "", "The Deed is yours: QuarryPlus becomes craftable, the residents vote, and Bram signs as witness."]
			x: 10.0d
			y: 0.8d
			dependencies: ["9AD7611960B0EDA4", "86824CC3F51032B9", "64ABC3E0D32A9056"]
