			id: "ABE39B0CA5A019ED"
			title: "Set the Quarry on the Marker and Switch It On"
			subtitle: "Tobin's arc closes."
			icon: "quarryplus:quarry"
			description: ["Tobin: \"Pad's cut, marker's typed, lane's live. Rig flat against the marker, facing in, and switch it on. I am extremely calm about this.\"", "", "Hold the QuarryPlus Quarry, set it flat against the Flexible Marker you already typed and facing in, and switch it on off the lane you already ran. It builds its own frame.", "", "The shaft sinks and the quarry runs. It is the biggest thing Tobin has ever been responsible for, and his arc closes here."]
			x: 12.0d
